WEBVTT

00:00.370 --> 00:01.760
What's going on?

00:02.130 --> 00:03.480
What is that?

00:09.280 --> 00:10.780
<i>What's happening?</i>

00:14.480 --> 00:15.930
H-Hey.

00:15.930 --> 00:17.120
What is that?

00:44.550 --> 00:45.530
What is that?!

00:45.530 --> 00:46.630
It's a monster!

01:07.170 --> 01:09.050
<b>Season Two</b>

02:20.110 --> 02:24.240
<b>Night Seventeen   Mutation Hazard</b>

02:20.110 --> 02:24.240
<b>Night Seventeen   Mutation Hazard</b>

02:23.030 --> 02:24.730
What shall we do, Young Master?

02:24.730 --> 02:27.240
Perhaps we should help.

02:27.850 --> 02:29.440
Let's wait and watch a bit longer.

02:29.440 --> 02:30.890
Kuzunoha-sensei!

02:31.360 --> 02:34.080
It's an emergency! There are 
monsters in the city, too!

02:34.080 --> 02:36.220
They're running amok all over the place.

02:36.220 --> 02:38.630
The area around the Gotetsu is in chaos.

02:38.630 --> 02:40.320
We should prepare to flee at once.

02:40.320 --> 02:41.630
This place is dangerous, too.

02:41.990 --> 02:43.520
<i>They're in the city, too?</i>

02:43.520 --> 02:47.350
<i>So he wasn't the demons' only ploy.</i>

02:47.840 --> 02:52.520
<i>I could probably quell the disturbance, 
but I should act carefully.</i>

02:53.500 --> 02:56.260
<i>First, I need you two to calm down.</i>

02:57.340 --> 02:59.230
<i>Then, it's a bit early, but...</i>

03:01.390 --> 03:03.820
<i>I'd like your answer to the 
question I asked before.</i>

03:04.380 --> 03:06.810
<i>Would you like to retake your homeland?</i>

03:07.410 --> 03:10.620
Luria and I are in agreement.

03:10.620 --> 03:14.570
The Aensland family name and 
the land of Kaleneon...

03:14.570 --> 03:20.990
If that's the cost of starting 
over there, I will gladly pay it.

03:21.620 --> 03:22.620
Me, too.

03:24.560 --> 03:26.590
I have no attachments.

03:27.840 --> 03:29.310
<i>Very well.</i>

03:29.590 --> 03:32.180
<i>I'll find a safe place for you right away.</i>

03:32.180 --> 03:34.470
<i>Stay hidden until then.</i>

03:34.470 --> 03:35.510
Okay.

03:44.370 --> 03:45.450
Jin!

03:45.910 --> 03:47.540
From our teacher.

03:47.540 --> 03:48.950
Thanks.

03:52.100 --> 03:54.680
It sure does howl a lot.

03:54.680 --> 03:57.370
I wouldn't want to eat that.

03:57.370 --> 04:00.040
Shiki, is there any way to restore him?

04:00.310 --> 04:03.810
It's not impossible, but it 
would be quite difficult.

04:04.400 --> 04:05.960
Nor am I inclined to try.

04:06.400 --> 04:10.090
I see. Then could you verify the damage 
that's been done to the city?

04:10.690 --> 04:11.970
Certainly.

04:11.970 --> 04:16.220
I'll contact Lime telepathically and summon 
a few individuals from the demiplane.

04:16.220 --> 04:19.120
I'll have them retrieve the 
store merchandise and inventory.

04:19.740 --> 04:20.740
Young Master!

04:20.740 --> 04:24.330
If this were a historical drama, 
this would be the climax of the story.

04:25.190 --> 04:25.780
What?

04:26.090 --> 04:29.720
The finale depends on how 
we make it through this.

04:29.720 --> 04:31.120
That's what's going on here.

04:31.730 --> 04:33.980
The demons' ploy has thrown 
the city into chaos.

04:33.980 --> 04:38.920
Both heartless merchants and good 
townsfolk are caught in the commotion.

04:38.920 --> 04:44.850
Thus, we should fight for the outcome 
we desire and earn their gratitude.

04:44.850 --> 04:47.420
We'll have our choice of rewards!

04:48.650 --> 04:52.050
<i>Sh-She's become a real Echigoya.</i>

04:52.050 --> 04:56.750
Rewards aside, some trading guilds 
that are hostile toward us

04:56.750 --> 04:58.940
may disappear under these circumstances.

04:58.940 --> 05:00.860
Well, that's great news.

05:00.860 --> 05:04.220
We can take advantage of the confusion 
to take out a few foolish merchants.

05:04.220 --> 05:06.550
Save the Hissatsu-style assassinating 
for another episode.

05:06.550 --> 05:12.270
This time, we'll act as heroes of justice 
and bring this commotion under control.

05:12.830 --> 05:15.960
<i>So we're going the Hachidai Shogun 
or Old Noble of Mito route.</i>

05:16.290 --> 05:20.950
We won't earn anyone's gratitude if 
we act without anyone's knowledge.

05:20.950 --> 05:24.260
Isn't that the way of the hyuman world?

05:24.260 --> 05:25.470
Mhm.

05:25.470 --> 05:28.430
<i>There's a certain logic 
to what Tomoe's saying.</i>

05:28.710 --> 05:30.970
But what should we do about the demons?

05:30.970 --> 05:35.830
They may not like us acting 
to resolve the situation.

05:35.830 --> 05:40.720
Young Master, do you still intend to 
associate with demons after this?

05:40.720 --> 05:42.270
Well, eventually.

05:42.710 --> 05:44.150
But Rona-san...

05:45.050 --> 05:47.990
No, Rona tricked me.

05:48.330 --> 05:51.920
So maybe we're free to quell the commotion

05:51.920 --> 05:56.410
as long as we're not directly 
engaging with the demons.

05:57.120 --> 06:00.000
You ignored our strategy meeting.

06:00.460 --> 06:03.080
You're starting to resemble Sofia, Rona.

06:03.430 --> 06:07.800
You must be joking. 
Don't compare me to that battle junkie.

06:08.730 --> 06:11.750
More importantly, Io, I hope 
preparations are coming along.

06:11.750 --> 06:16.230
Of course. However, regarding Kuzunoha...

06:16.230 --> 06:19.640
Oh, I haven't done anything 
to break our promise.

06:19.980 --> 06:21.900
You're a nasty woman, aren't you?

06:22.460 --> 06:24.890
I feel sorry for Kuzunoha.

06:24.890 --> 06:27.610
I'll take that as a compliment.

06:27.610 --> 06:28.870
What about the rings?

06:29.140 --> 06:31.560
We've moved from prototype 
to finished product.

06:31.560 --> 06:34.080
They should suppress the 
goddess's power again.

06:34.450 --> 06:38.050
I'm sure you know, but we will 
settle the matter with this.

06:38.050 --> 06:40.020
You don't need to tell me.

06:40.020 --> 06:46.100
Even if Hibiki, hero of Limia, has gotten 
stronger, we'll simply destroy her.

06:46.100 --> 06:49.920
Then the hyumans will lose another nation.

06:50.400 --> 06:53.720
Demons will finally have their 
chance to enjoy the spring.

06:54.330 --> 06:58.100
<i>Listen to me. Head directly to 
the Kuzunoha Trading Company.</i>

06:58.680 --> 07:01.610
<i>My employees will show you to a safe place.</i>

07:01.610 --> 07:02.930
Understood.

07:02.930 --> 07:04.620
Be careful, Kuzunoha-san.

07:04.620 --> 07:05.340
<i>I will.</i>

07:06.890 --> 07:08.220
Kuzunoha-dono.

07:08.700 --> 07:12.190
<i>Rembrandt-san! 
I'm relieved you're all right.</i>

07:12.190 --> 07:16.540
Forgive me. We still don't understand 
exactly what's happening.

07:16.940 --> 07:21.770
<i>Same here. We only know that 
monsters are rampaging in the city.</i>

07:21.770 --> 07:25.490
<i>Your daughters seem determined 
to defeat them.</i>

07:25.490 --> 07:30.310
I see. So my daughters are bent 
on doing something about them.

07:31.310 --> 07:35.160
K-Kuzunoha-dono, that mustn't 
be allowed to happen!

07:35.160 --> 07:38.980
<i>I promise I'll protect them. Don't worry.</i>

07:36.410 --> 07:40.540
We should have academy security
and the army work together,

07:39.460 --> 07:41.980
Darling, let's trust Kuzunoha-sama.

07:40.540 --> 07:42.500
and if that doesn't work, we'll use...

07:42.360 --> 07:43.840
Darling!

07:45.130 --> 07:48.320
I-In any case, I'm heading 
to the merchant's guild.

07:48.320 --> 07:51.760
The local guild representative 
isn't a total stranger to me.

07:51.760 --> 07:54.220
Then I'll accompany you.

07:54.220 --> 07:57.130
I'd like to say hello to Zara-san, too.

07:57.130 --> 08:00.250
A-All right... But...

08:00.250 --> 08:04.630
<i>You're friends with the 
guild representative?</i>

08:04.630 --> 08:08.380
Yes. We once ran neighboring shops 
and had a friendly rivalry going.

08:08.380 --> 08:10.150
We were birds of a feather.

08:10.150 --> 08:10.980
Lisa.

08:10.980 --> 08:13.910
<i>I see. I'm a little surprised.</i>

08:14.410 --> 08:18.420
Was it yesterday that you met with Zara?

08:18.420 --> 08:23.160
<i>Yes. Unfortunately, he refused 
to acknowledge me as a merchant.</i>

08:23.750 --> 08:25.370
<i>I couldn't feel more ashamed.</i>

08:25.370 --> 08:28.540
Despite how he seems, he can be kind.

08:28.540 --> 08:31.180
He just doesn't always 
say everything he should.

08:31.180 --> 08:35.900
I prefer that to people like you 
who stab people in the back.

08:35.900 --> 08:38.810
Lisa, I sense some animosity.

08:36.860 --> 08:40.860
<i>I guess there's no room for naïveté 
in the world of merchants.</i>

08:41.260 --> 08:43.780
Well, we should go.

08:43.780 --> 08:47.730
<i>Right. Just in case, 
I'll assign guards to escort you.</i>

08:47.730 --> 08:48.600
Guards?

08:53.540 --> 08:55.490
<i>You can count on them to defend you.</i>

08:56.060 --> 09:00.520
<i>If needed, you can tell people you used 
magical equipment to summon them.</i>

09:01.010 --> 09:06.140
I-I forgot that you can cast 
summoning spells, as well.

09:06.770 --> 09:08.880
<i>Take care of yourselves.</i>

09:09.530 --> 09:10.640
<i>We'll meet again later.</i>

09:20.060 --> 09:22.100
H-His allies...

09:22.100 --> 09:23.120
He ate them.

09:26.000 --> 09:28.070
The academy still hasn't 
dispatched any forces?

09:28.930 --> 09:31.570
They should be prepared 
for emergencies, right?

09:31.570 --> 09:33.050
They've just arrived.

09:37.990 --> 09:39.500
Purple Coats.

09:39.720 --> 09:43.650
Those are the academy's most 
powerful fighters, right?

09:43.650 --> 09:46.980
An lisalite shesta shiz.

09:46.980 --> 09:50.560
Huh. They're prepared for all elements.

09:51.110 --> 09:52.470
Flame Sword!

09:52.470 --> 09:54.120
Icicle Spear!

09:54.120 --> 09:55.670
Dust Fang!

09:55.670 --> 09:56.520
Gale Cross!

10:01.220 --> 10:02.060
Wha—

10:02.770 --> 10:04.780
What an interesting monster.

10:05.930 --> 10:12.160
It's immune to three out of four basic 
elements and absorbs water magic.

10:12.160 --> 10:15.040
If their only effective flame 
spell is that one, then...

10:16.620 --> 10:20.750
O beautiful goddess, protect our academy!

10:20.750 --> 10:23.930
Grant your blessing to your devotee!

10:23.930 --> 10:26.630
His mana suddenly increased.

10:26.630 --> 10:28.930
So that's the goddess's blessing.

10:28.930 --> 10:31.870
Increasing his mana won't 
accomplish anything.

10:31.870 --> 10:34.810
Without enough fire users,

10:35.950 --> 10:37.820
under these circumstances...

10:41.760 --> 10:46.040
Figures. They merely increased its power.

10:46.040 --> 10:47.020
Right.

10:47.020 --> 10:50.120
Young Master, I've determined 
the situation in the city.

10:50.630 --> 10:53.460
I telepathically confirmed 
with Eris and the others

10:53.460 --> 10:56.570
that roughly fifty monsters 
have appeared in town.

10:56.570 --> 11:01.910
Teleportation circles have been destroyed, 
and there's some telepathic interference.

11:01.910 --> 11:02.590
I see.

11:03.150 --> 11:05.790
<i>Telepathic interference 
will make things tough.</i>

11:05.790 --> 11:08.100
<i>It still seems to be working 
around here, though.</i>

11:08.100 --> 11:09.060
Young Master.

11:15.860 --> 11:18.190
Th-They've already been wiped out?

11:18.190 --> 11:21.690
They were like food leaping 
onto a plate to be eaten.

11:21.690 --> 11:22.780
What about Jin and the others?

11:23.160 --> 11:25.680
The academy's strongest fighters...

11:25.680 --> 11:27.660
Can we even beat it?

11:27.660 --> 11:30.320
They're completely dispirited.

11:30.320 --> 11:36.620
Honestly. The moment I thought about 
praising them, they disappointed me.

11:37.670 --> 11:39.560
<i>I feel like she's saying that to me.</i>

11:39.560 --> 11:43.760
Shiki, don't you think you've 
been too easy on them?

11:43.760 --> 11:46.640
You should teach them to fight

11:46.640 --> 11:49.390
by making the most of their strengths 
and broadening their perspectives.

11:49.390 --> 11:51.130
F-Forgive me.

11:51.130 --> 11:54.380
<i>Utilize your strengths 
with a broad perspective?</i>

11:55.120 --> 11:57.480
<i>In terms of my own strengths...</i>

11:57.480 --> 12:02.350
<i>That power is another option 
available to me, too.</i>

12:03.380 --> 12:06.740
Mio and Shiki, 
issue instructions to the students.

12:06.740 --> 12:09.090
If it looks like they'll be wiped out, 
you can assist them.

12:09.090 --> 12:10.060
What?

12:11.050 --> 12:12.120
Did you not hear me?

12:12.600 --> 12:16.580
Only issue instructions for as long 
as you can, so they gain experience.

12:16.940 --> 12:18.160
Understood.

12:19.220 --> 12:20.890
Tomoe, come with me.

12:20.890 --> 12:21.550
As you wish.

12:21.810 --> 12:26.260
We're off to rescue the guests so 
they'll be indebted to us, aren't we?

12:27.750 --> 12:29.120
<i>Sometimes it is rough</i>

12:29.120 --> 12:30.620
<i>when I have a follower</i>

12:30.620 --> 12:31.850
<i>with instincts too keen.</i>

12:36.240 --> 12:38.630
The Purple Coats...

12:39.460 --> 12:41.730
We should flee quickly.

12:42.270 --> 12:45.200
The city is full of monsters like that one.

12:45.200 --> 12:46.740
But we can't stay here.

12:46.740 --> 12:47.670
Excuse us.

12:48.170 --> 12:49.400
Who are you?

12:49.400 --> 12:50.620
We've never seen you before.

12:50.620 --> 12:53.580
<i>Is that Lily, Princess of Gritonia?</i>

12:55.320 --> 13:01.010
<i>Over there are the bishop and Shinai-san 
of the temple, and Sairitsu-san of Laurel.</i>

13:01.010 --> 13:02.290
<i>And finally...</i>

13:03.790 --> 13:04.960
Hi.

13:04.960 --> 13:07.040
<i>Luto's here, too?</i>

13:07.040 --> 13:07.930
Who are you?

13:08.630 --> 13:12.480
Don't you know access to 
this area is restricted?

13:12.790 --> 13:16.680
<i>Who is he? I feel like 
I've seen him before.</i>

13:19.010 --> 13:21.000
<i>Oh, right. He's the academy headmaster.</i>

13:21.850 --> 13:24.850
I am Tomoe of the Kuzunoha Trading Company.

13:24.850 --> 13:27.480
This is my master.

13:27.480 --> 13:29.990
<i>I'm Kuzunoha, a part-time teacher.</i>

13:29.990 --> 13:35.540
<i>It seems the guests hadn't been 
evacuated yet, so I've come to help.</i>

13:37.620 --> 13:39.600
I see. You came to help, did you?

13:39.600 --> 13:41.460
But what do you intend to do?

13:41.990 --> 13:46.600
It won't be easy to lead an evacuation 
while monsters wander the city.

13:47.000 --> 13:51.910
Headmaster, do you know where 
we might find a safe location?

13:51.910 --> 13:53.030
Of course I do.

13:53.030 --> 13:56.280
Then think of that place.

13:56.280 --> 13:58.560
I shall teleport us there.

13:58.860 --> 14:00.570
Teleport?!

14:00.570 --> 14:04.810
This many people, to a place the 
caster has never visited before?

14:04.810 --> 14:07.530
Impossible! There's no such spell!

14:07.920 --> 14:11.760
<i>Teleportation and telepathy are generally 
considered high-level spells,</i>

14:11.760 --> 14:13.980
<i>even though we casually 
use them all the time.</i>

14:13.980 --> 14:16.650
Oh, but you'll find that it's quite possible.

14:16.650 --> 14:21.140
That said, I can't blame you for doubting me.

14:21.140 --> 14:23.000
Tomoe, was it?

14:23.000 --> 14:26.560
Why don't you teleport 
me to the stands first?

14:27.160 --> 14:28.320
<i>I see.</i>

14:28.820 --> 14:32.560
<i>He's pretending we've never met before 
and offering himself up as a guinea pig.</i>

14:32.560 --> 14:35.230
B-But, False-dono...

14:35.230 --> 14:38.020
It's a good suggestion, Headmaster.

14:38.430 --> 14:42.890
False-dono is surely capable 
of examining her spell.

14:42.890 --> 14:46.080
I appreciate that, Lily-sama.

14:48.910 --> 14:52.400
False-dono, please step through here.

14:52.400 --> 14:54.360
Through here? Well, well.

14:54.770 --> 14:57.610
I see a similar mist over there.

14:58.060 --> 15:00.540
Does that mean these are connected?

15:02.840 --> 15:03.620
He vanished!

15:03.970 --> 15:05.080
Hello!

15:06.560 --> 15:07.840
It's true!

15:08.610 --> 15:09.980
What's going on?

15:09.980 --> 15:11.340
He actually teleported!

15:11.340 --> 15:12.890
What kind of spell is that?

15:11.690 --> 15:15.340
Impressive. I've never seen anything like it.

15:15.780 --> 15:18.460
Is it perhaps the power of that sword?

15:18.890 --> 15:20.820
Indeed it is.

15:20.820 --> 15:24.300
False-dono, you've got quite the eye.

15:21.750 --> 15:24.780
<i>Her sword? But that's Tomoe's own power.</i>

15:25.090 --> 15:27.170
What do you think, everyone?

15:27.170 --> 15:30.400
Why don't we accept their benevolence?

15:30.800 --> 15:32.130
O-Of course!

15:31.160 --> 15:32.550
Teleport us right away!

15:32.550 --> 15:33.480
I'm first!

15:33.480 --> 15:34.530
No, me!

15:34.090 --> 15:35.370
Me, too.

15:35.370 --> 15:36.750
I'm first.

15:36.750 --> 15:39.050
No, wait! I'm first!

15:37.620 --> 15:39.050
Your Majesty, we should hurry.

15:39.840 --> 15:43.800
I'm fine. I have an obligation 
to oversee things from here.

15:43.800 --> 15:44.960
But, Father...

15:45.470 --> 15:46.820
Go without me.

15:46.820 --> 15:48.960
Your Majesty, I can't do that.

15:50.000 --> 15:54.000
That's my child over there.

15:56.170 --> 15:58.060
<i>So they're Limia royalty.</i>

15:58.430 --> 15:59.400
Young Master.

16:00.820 --> 16:04.970
Hold on to that. You handle things here.

16:04.970 --> 16:07.350
<i>Huh? What does she want me to do?</i>

16:07.350 --> 16:08.340
Excuse us.

16:09.560 --> 16:10.510
Your Majesty.

16:13.200 --> 16:16.730
Kuzunoha, can you use that sword?

16:16.730 --> 16:20.010
<i>In other words, he's asking 
if I can teleport, right?</i>

16:20.420 --> 16:21.940
<i>Yes, I can.</i>

16:22.210 --> 16:25.780
Then will you take me down there?

16:25.780 --> 16:27.050
Father!

16:27.050 --> 16:28.580
Your Majesty, what are you doing?

16:28.580 --> 16:32.430
Limia nobility are harming the academy.

16:32.430 --> 16:37.380
If people don't see me doing everything 
I can to stop it, then I'm done for.

16:37.760 --> 16:41.550
Besides, perhaps Ilumgand 
will return to his senses

16:41.550 --> 16:43.480
if he hears me or his 
father speaking to him.

16:48.480 --> 16:50.390
Go after his weak points!

16:50.750 --> 16:53.140
Strike at his openings!

16:53.140 --> 16:55.880
Back line, cast physical enhancement spells.

16:55.880 --> 16:57.620
Boost their speed so he's at their mercy.

16:59.380 --> 17:01.570
He's quick for his size!

17:01.570 --> 17:03.000
Easier said than done!

17:04.830 --> 17:07.180
Calm yourself, Ilumgand!

17:07.180 --> 17:09.420
Ilumgand, it's your father!

17:09.420 --> 17:11.160
Don't you recognize me?

17:12.960 --> 17:14.580
Ilumgand...

17:15.290 --> 17:17.550
He's rampaging like a monster.

17:17.550 --> 17:19.850
Still, we must see this through,

17:20.390 --> 17:22.890
no matter the outcome.

17:22.890 --> 17:23.560
Kuzunoha.

17:23.920 --> 17:28.030
Is there any magic medicine 
that would restore my son?

17:28.600 --> 17:34.270
<i>I'm sorry, but I've never seen 
that kind of mutation before, either.</i>

17:38.470 --> 17:39.340
All right!

17:51.100 --> 17:52.090
No way...

17:52.370 --> 17:53.380
I don't believe it.

17:53.380 --> 17:54.960
He regenerated.

17:54.960 --> 17:56.060
Ilum...

17:58.470 --> 17:59.600
Damn it!

18:02.010 --> 18:04.010
Pull yourselves together, everyone!

18:04.010 --> 18:05.850
Let's regroup!

18:12.680 --> 18:13.980
<i>A mutant from the city?</i>

18:14.540 --> 18:16.270
<i>Ugh, gross.</i>

18:16.270 --> 18:18.130
Damn you, monster!

18:18.130 --> 18:19.790
You must flee, Your Majesty!

18:30.380 --> 18:34.240
<i>Shiki, there are injured people 
in the stands. Come heal them.</i>

18:34.600 --> 18:36.710
<i>Mio, keep directing the students.</i>

18:36.130 --> 18:37.840
Father, please run!

18:38.090 --> 18:40.160
<i>What is he doing?!</i>

18:42.590 --> 18:46.470
<i>My Concealing Kai should keep my mana 
matter hidden from the royalty.</i>

18:53.330 --> 18:55.520
<i>Are you all right, Your Highness?</i>

18:58.070 --> 19:00.770
I-I'll explain the details later.

19:00.770 --> 19:06.150
<i>I... I have a feeling I just 
screwed up, but for now...</i>

19:09.560 --> 19:11.810
<i>Non-elemental magic is effective.</i>

19:12.780 --> 19:14.890
<i>I'll aim for its beak.</i>

19:20.410 --> 19:22.750
<i>That was close.</i>

19:23.730 --> 19:25.240
<i>Will he be okay?</i>

19:25.240 --> 19:26.930
Are you all right, Father?

19:27.280 --> 19:28.420
Are you?

19:29.280 --> 19:34.200
<i>I hope this thing with the prince 
won't cause new problems.</i>

19:35.770 --> 19:38.700
Enough already!

19:40.410 --> 19:43.100
It'll regenerate from any 
half-hearted attacks.

19:43.560 --> 19:45.420
You should know that by now.

19:45.420 --> 19:46.810
I-If we could just block its vision...

19:48.810 --> 19:52.510
Oh, come on. I told you, 
anything but fire is useless.

19:53.320 --> 19:54.700
Seft aluoste eda.

19:57.370 --> 19:59.850
A spell? No, this is...

20:02.440 --> 20:03.890
An overpowering roar!

20:06.390 --> 20:08.550
I-I can't protect everyone.

20:11.230 --> 20:13.070
Th-The front line...

20:13.520 --> 20:16.740
Shifu, can you cast that spell on my arrows?

20:16.740 --> 20:22.240
I-Impossible. Even if I could, they would 
explode in less than ten seconds.

20:21.540 --> 20:24.150
That's fine. Izumo, can you move?

20:24.440 --> 20:25.650
Barely.

20:25.650 --> 20:27.020
Support me.

20:27.020 --> 20:28.470
What are you planning?

20:28.470 --> 20:30.000
I'm going to take that thing down.

20:30.000 --> 20:30.610
What?

20:31.120 --> 20:34.540
Jin and the others would get 
caught in a high-power spell.

20:34.990 --> 20:38.200
Magically enchanting my 
arrows is our only option.

20:38.630 --> 20:42.630
Let me show off for Shiki-san for once.

20:45.830 --> 20:47.920
You've only got ten seconds.

20:47.920 --> 20:49.270
Thanks, Shifu.

20:49.270 --> 20:53.000
Oh, fine. The rest is up to you.

20:59.100 --> 21:02.200
<i>Higher. Higher!</i>

21:04.250 --> 21:04.880
What?

21:09.220 --> 21:12.160
Nameless children of the earth, 
grant me your strength!

21:26.800 --> 21:29.340
<i>It's okay. I have...</i>

21:31.550 --> 21:33.210
...all of them on my side!

23:34.890 --> 23:38.850
Night Eighteen: 
"Fall of the Academy City."

23:35.180 --> 23:40.020
<b>Next Time</b>

23:36.770 --> 23:40.360
<b>Fall of the Academy City</b>
